  "id": "opioid-dependence",
  "term": "opioid dependence",
  "definition": "In this source, opioid dependence is discussed as a state in which early abstinence can be accompanied by broad problems in higher-order thinking. These cognitive difficulties are suggested to be linked to withdrawal-related disruption in the prefrontal cortex and may be partly temporary.",
